	TAD (XOJMP
	DCA CURCHR	/ RESET CHARACTER-DECODE POINTER
	ISZ CURBPT	/ INSURE THAT SHORT RECORDS ARE OUTPUT
	JMS I [DMPBUF	/ DUMP THE BUFFER
	JMP I OUTCTZ



/   "NEGXX"  -  TRANSMIT THE COMPLEMENT OF ONE X-REGISTER TO ANOTHER

NEGXX,	JMS I (X2SET	/ SET POINTERS
	TAD I RBASE2
	RAR
	CML CLA RAL
	DCA I RBASE1	/ TRANSMIT COMPLEMENTED SIGN
	ISZ RBASE1
	ISZ RBASE2
	TAD I RBASE2
	DCA I RBASE1
	ISZ CNT
	JMP .-5
	JMP I [RNI
