/   "CMPAAM"  -  COMPARE A-REGISTERS AS 12-BIT POSITIVE INTEGERS

CMPAAM,	JMS I (A2SET	/ SET REGISTER POINTERS
	TAD I RBASE1
	CLL CIA
	TAD I RBASE2
	SNA CLA
	JMP I (STEQL	/ REGISTERS ARE EQUAL
	JMP I (CMPTST	/ GO SEE WHICH ORDER



