	MQA
	SMA CLA		/ INPUT OR OUTPUT?
	TAD (XOJMP-XIJMP	/ OUTPUT
	TAD (XIJMP
	DCA CURCHR	/ RESET STEP-POINTER
	DCA CURBPT	/ RESET BUFFER-POINTER
